                                                                                        <p>I confirm and authorize Risebird, (Arhat Talent Solutions Private Limited) and its partners and customers to use my ID proof data for verifying my identity to appear for an interview.</p>
                                                                                        <p>I am aware and agree that this interview will be recorded and will be shared only with my employer in fully secured and encrypted format. It will be permanently deleted from all records in 2-3 weeks' time.</p>
